            <ArticleTitle>Prevalence of prediabetes and its association with obesity among college students in Kuwait: A cross-sectional study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.diabres.2016.07.001</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0168-8227(16)30229-7</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This cross-sectional study sought to estimate the prevalence of prediabetes and assess its association with obesity among young adults in Kuwait; a country with a high prevalence of obesity and diabetes. The estimated prevalence of prediabetes was 6.3% (95% CI: 4.8-8.1) and obesity was associated with elevated prediabetes prevalence.</AbstractText>
